[hermes:err-live] ### milvus-io/milvus#51393 — feat: nested element-level indexes for plain scalar arrays
[hermes:err-live] - State: `OPEN` · Closing-link from PR: no · Source: `cross`
[hermes:err-live] - URL: https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus/pull/51393
